# Workshop Editing

- Use Cursor's native editing tools so changes remain visible in the diff/review UI.
- Prefer one small, reviewable edit at a time.
- Preserve comments that explain mechanics or numerical concepts.
- Do not replace an educational implementation with a more sophisticated abstraction.
- When modifying structural parameters, briefly explain the expected mechanical effect.
